.TH "Cars Sports Racing terrain generator for tracks" "6" "March 2012" "Cars Sports Racing 1.x" "Games"
.SH NAME
.LP
csr-trackgen \- Cars Sports Racing terrain generator for tracks
.SH SYNOPSIS
.LP
\fBcsr-trackgen\fP -c category -n name [-a] [-m] [-s] [-S] [-E <n> [-H <nb>]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.TP
This manual describes the track terrain generator that is shipped with Cars Sports Racing.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -c \fIcategory\fP
track category (road, speedway, dirt...)
.TP
.B -n \fIname\fP
track name
.TP
.B -b
draw bump track
.TP
.B -B
Don't use terrain border (relief supplied int clockwise, ext CC)
.TP
.B -a 
draw all (default is track only)
.TP
.B -s
split the track and the terrain
.TP
.B -S
split all
.TP
.B -E \fI<n>\fP
save elevation file n
.RS 4
.IP "0: all elevatation files" 4
.IP "1: elevation file of terrain + track" 4
.IP "2: elevation file of terrain with track white"
.IP "3: track only"
.IP "4: track elevations with height steps" 4
.RE
.TP
.B -H \fI<nb>\fP
nb of height steps for 4th elevation file [30]
